{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2023-06-30 12:30:00', 'title': 'IEH CORP ANNOUNCES NEW ORDERS FOR CONNECTORS IN SUPPORT OF BOEING 737MAX', 'text': 'BROOKLYN, NY / ACCESSWIRE / JUNE 30, 2023 / IEH CORPORATION (OTC:IEHC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IN THE PAST WEEK IT HAS BOOKED OVER $1 MILLION IN NEW ORDERS FOR THEIR HYPERBOLOID CONNECTORS IN SUPPORT OF THE BOEING 737MAX JET. DAVE OFFERMAN, PRESIDENT AND CEO OF IEH CORPORATION COMMENTED, "THIS IS A VERY POSITIVE DEVELOPMENT FOR OUR COMPANY, ESPECIALLY FOR THE REVENUE WE GENERATE FROM THE COMMERCIAL AEROSPACE SECTOR.'}